

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Shiri sarrafa-ƙwaƙwalwa: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Fitarwa rubuta: ( txt kwafi daga: 5 tsawo: 5 ).
Fitarwa rubuta: ( txt kwafi tsallake: 5, datse ), sabon-layi.

Shiri tsaftace.

usedMemory1 := (Shiri ƙwaƙwalwa ? 0).


